# Haruka Scene v5
# Math checks (2026-11-17, Handoff/Checklist_Math_VR.md): XrDemo plus a 3 cm wall to throw small pebbles at (continuous collision),
# a static torus with a Mesh collider and a light grabbable cone with a Convex Hull collider, and two beeping sounds 8 m ahead
# (left: Silent Beyond Max with max 5 m, right: default falloff for comparison).
